oc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"State health departments provided supplementary epidemiologic data from case investigation records for cases with isolates containing a β -lactamase gene.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Ethnicity of two black patients was not reported.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}